      <p>Google Ads works for clinics when it is built around how patients and pet owners actually book. Urgent problems, routine appointments and high-value treatment are different searches with different value, so they need separate campaigns. Answer calls promptly, track booked appointments rather than clicks, and keep every ad within Google's health advertising rules.</p>

